    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Jason IP",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114703557112540408503/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU1F7HGsOYs19x0g9Q6baun1NAqbhsFwxScjCsyxMPXXDnq53Y=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "I’ve visited most CrossFit gyms in and around Montreal, and this one stands out as my favorite. Emilie, the coach and owner, offers excellent instruction, and the atmosphere is incredibly welcoming.",
        "time": 1750725612,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Radu Dragan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116617884821757002685/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXUJ02_EOjEtUDpKOv-GkXMq7Sn37VtLBX8QFABI1F9R_UhpgewjA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Great place for someone like me that is not in shape but with the help of the trainers can learn to scale down some of the exercises. It is almost like having a personal trainer at all times when you come.\nNathalie is a great trainer that helps a lot to keep me motivated, which is no small task.",
        "time": 1647613058,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Oksana Exell",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105594736699097656525/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWYGb72hunMHZYsPkGa5qpA5VhNZ1lBE4dnCHWemd_Hj7ouedG2=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I'm retired but decided to join the gym to improve my core and bone density -  best thing I ever did.  Emily the coach always takes the time to work with clients individually to make sure they have the right technique and build up their strength gradually.",
        "time": 1698277553,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Stephanie Murphy",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107292673655062341171/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI575ohoyqaWqfMbg3sVT86FZLyfBHLipJSTX3o3nk1Wg_mVA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Love this place. They are so welcoming and teach you every step of the way, accommodating to your level of fitness!",
        "time": 1749063830,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kirkbra Williams",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118147960450348334212/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVwzRlR1BOktzyOJ0fhoQ6CyHP_8LLds3raIVvbbHSo7dhJmt-1=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Getting back in to functional shape and thinking about going to a gym instead of CrossFit ? CrossFit Vaudreuil is where you need to come . No mirrors , and nobody on their phones occupying machines . All ages and levels of fitness . Excellent  beginner/foundational and advanced coaching. That’s one half ; the other is the amazing group vibe and encouragement you receive from this great pack of CrossFit members . Like no other CrossFit.\nInstead of joining  a gym ..join a community and see results . See you at the bar …You’ll get that one later .",
        "time": 1695487413,
        "translated": false
      }
